---
import dayjs from 'dayjs'
import {
  SOCIALS_LINKEDIN,
  SOCIALS_GITHUB,
  SOCIALS_LINKEDIN_PRINT,
  SOCIALS_GITHUB_PRINT,
} from 'constants/links'
import CVLayout from 'layouts/CVLayout.astro'
import { Printer } from '@lucide/astro'
import PersonJsonLd from 'components/PersonJsonLd.astro'
export const prerender = false
const workExperienceYears = dayjs(new Date()).diff('2015-03-01', 'year')
---

<CVLayout title="Yegor Belov’s CV">
  <meta
    slot="head"
    name="description"
    content={`Yegor Belov is a front-end developer with ${workExperienceYears}+ years of experience. He builds robust, scalable products for fast-paced, high-growth companies.`}
  />
  <PersonJsonLd slot="head" />
  <section class="top-section">
    <div>
      <div class="hstack">
        <button class="screen" onclick="window.print()" title="Print this page">
          <Printer />
        </button>
        <h2>Yegor Belov</h2>
      </div>

      <h3 class="role">Staff Software engineer · Frontend · Fintech · London, UK</h3>
    </div>

    <div class="main-links">
      <div>
        <a href="mailto:yegor@belov.codes">yegor@belov.codes</a>
      </div>

      <div>
        <span class="screen">
          <a href={SOCIALS_LINKEDIN} target="_blank"> LinkedIn </a>
        </span>
        <span class="print">
          {SOCIALS_LINKEDIN_PRINT}
        </span>
      </div>
      <div>
        <span class="screen">
          <a href={SOCIALS_GITHUB} target="_blank"> GitHub </a>
        </span>
        <span class="print">
          {SOCIALS_GITHUB_PRINT}
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <h3 class="section">Summary</h3>

  <p class="lead">
    I’m a lead frontend engineer with {workExperienceYears}+ years of experience — {
      workExperienceYears - 2
    } of those in fintech. I care deeply about what compounds: clean architecture, delightful
    UX, and a culture where people feel safe to speak up and empowered to contribute.
  </p>
  <p class="lead">
    Start-up experience taught me how to build a scalable, maintainable platform from the
    ground up and what mistakes to avoid.
  </p>

  <h3 class="section" id="xp">Latest experience</h3>
  <p>
    You can find the full list on my <a href={SOCIALS_LINKEDIN} target="_blank">
      LinkedIn page.
    </a>
  </p>

  <ul class="lined">
    <li>
      <div>
        <h4>
          <a href="https://getapron.com" target="_blank"> Apron Payments </a> - Founding Frontend
          Engineer – London, UK
        </h4>
        <p><span class="subheader">B2B Payments SaaS. 2022 - present</span></p>
        <p>
          · Architected frontend platform from the ground up (monorepo structure, CI/CD,
          deployment infra, error monitoring etc.), still underpinning the apps, back
          office and website 9,000+ PRs later.
        </p>
        <p>
          · Shipped features across every product surface: payments, approval workflows,
          roles & permissions, bookkeeping, cards, expenses, back office and website.
        </p>
        <p>
          · Led 10-person frontend group through leadership transition without
          line-managing it. Established unified backlog, shared operational metrics, and
          bi-weekly forum. Scaled 11 initiatives to run under 6 leads within 3 weeks.
          Hired and mentored engineers from mid-level to IC6; co-authored engineering
          levels framework and AI engineering standards.
        </p>
        <p class="tech">
          <span class="tech-label">Tech stack:</span>
          <code>TS</code>
          <code>React</code>
          <code>react-query</code>
          <code>vanilla-extract</code>
          <code>vite</code>
          <code>Playwright</code>
          <code>Storybook</code>
          <code>Sentry</code>
          <code>OpenReplay</code>
          <code>GitHub Actions</code>
          <code>Firebase/GCP</code>
        </p>
      </div>
    </li>

    <li>
      <h4>
        <a href="https://pleo.io" target="_blank">Pleo</a> – Engineering Lead – remote (Europe)
      </h4>

      <p>
        <span class="subheader"> B2B Payments SaaS. 2020 - 2022 </span>
      </p>
      <p>
        Led 7-person Productised Onboarding team to unblock sales-led growth. Shipped
        logic-heavy branched flows handling multi-market regulations and entity types.
        Pleo hit unicorn valuation ($4.7B) during that time.
      </p>
      <p class="tech">
        <span class="tech-label">Tech stack:</span>
        <code>TS</code>
        <code>React</code>
        <code>Emotion</code>
        <code>SWR</code>
      </p>
    </li>

    <li>
      <h4>
        <a href="https://revolut.com" target="_blank">Revolut</a> – Senior Frontend developer
        – Moscow, Russia
      </h4>
      <p>
        <span class="subheader"> A Challenger bank. 2017 - 2020 </span>
      </p>
      <p>
        As one of the first 4 frontend engineers, shaped early tech stack decisions and
        hiring as the team scaled. Built revolut.com, shipped Revolut Business launch
        features, and delivered in-app customer support chat widget. Built Expense
        Management, Business Perks, Business Connect (API integrations marketplace), and
        Open Banking support. Delivered both customer-facing and back-office UIs.
      </p>
      <p>
        Scaled frontend architecture and code review processes as the team grew from 4 to
        72 engineers over 3 years.
      </p>
      <p class="tech">
        <span class="tech-label">Tech stack:</span>
        <code>TS</code>
        <code>React</code>
        <code>Redux</code>
        <code>Ramda</code>
        <code>styled-components</code>
        <code>webpack</code>
      </p>
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h3 class="section">Stack</h3>

  <p class="tech skill">
    <b class="tech-label">Core Languages &amp; Frameworks:</b>
    <code>TypeScript</code>
    <code>JavaScript</code>
    <code>React</code>
    <code>Redux</code>
    <code>Context API</code>
    <code>React Query</code>
    <code>SWR</code>
    <code>CSS-in-JS</code>
    <code>Emotion</code>
    <code>vanilla-extract</code>
    <code>styled-components</code>
    <code>HTML5</code>
    <code>CSS3</code>
  </p>
  <p class="tech skill">
    <b class="tech-label">Frontend Tooling &amp; Testing:</b>
    <code>Vite</code>
    <code>Webpack</code>
    <code>Playwright</code>
    <code>Vitest</code>
    <code>React Testing Library</code>
    <code>Storybook</code>
    <code>ESLint</code>
    <code>Prettier</code>
  </p>
  <p class="tech skill">
    <b class="tech-label">CI/CD &amp; Infrastructure:</b>
    <code>GitHub Actions</code>
    <code>Docker</code>
    <code>Nginx</code>
    <code>Firebase</code>
    <code>GCP</code>
  </p>

  <h3 class="section">Education</h3>

  <ul class="lined">
    <li>
      <p><b>2015-2018:</b> Russian State University For The Humanities</p>
      <p><b>Postgraduate Studies, Computer Science </b></p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <p><b>2010-2015:</b> Russian State University For The Humanities</p>
      <p><b>Master's degree, Intelligent Systems </b></p>
    </li>
  </ul>
</CVLayout>

<style>
  .screen {
    @media print {
      display: none;
    }
  }
  .print {
    @media screen {
      display: none;
    }
  }
  .top-section {
    padding-top: 3rem;
    @media print {
      padding-top: 0;
    }

    @media (min-width: 768px) {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      .main-links {
        align-items: end;
        text-align: right;
        & > * {
          flex-direction: row-reverse;
        }
      }
    }
  }

  .role {
    margin-block: 0.5rem 0;
    font-size: 120%;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
  .section {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-block: 2.5rem 1rem;
    font-size: 85%;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-emphasis);
    &::after {
      content: '';
      flex: 1;
      height: 1px;
      background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-text) 15%, transparent);
    }
    @media print {
      margin-block-start: 1.5rem;
    }
  }
  .lead {
    font-size: 120%;
  }
  .subheader {
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    font-size: 90%;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }
  .tech {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    .tech-label {
      margin-right: 0.25rem;
      color: var(--color-text-secondary);
      font-size: 85%;
    }
    &.skill {
      margin-block: 0 1rem;
      .tech-label {
        margin-right: 0.5rem;
        color: var(--color-text);
        font-size: 100%;
        font-weight: 700;
      }
    }
    code {
      padding: 0.15em 0.45em;
      border-radius: 6px;
      background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-text) 10%, transparent);
      font-size: 80%;
      line-height: 1.5;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }
  }

  .main-links {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    @media screen {
      a {
        color: var(--color-text);
        text-decoration: underline;
      }
    }
  }

  @media print {
    a {
      color: var(--color-text);
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    li {
      break-inside: avoid;
    }
  }

  .hstack {
    display: flex;
    gap: 24px;
    margin-left: -48px;
    align-items: center;
    @media print {
      margin-left: 0;
    }
  }
  ul {
    list-style: none;
    position: relative;
  }
  ul.lined {
    li {
      position: relative;
      margin: 0;
      padding-bottom: 2rem;
      padding-left: 2rem;
      h4 {
        margin: 0 0 0.25rem;
        font-size: 115%;
      }
      p {
        margin: 0 0 0.6rem;
      }
      .subheader {
        margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
      }
      &:before {
        background-color: var(--color-emphasis);
        width: 2px;
        content: '';
        position: absolute;
        top: 0px;
        bottom: 0px;
        left: 0.5rem;
      }
      &:after {
        content: '';
        position: absolute;
        background-color: var(--color-emphasis);
        background-repeat: no-repeat;
        background-size: contain;
        left: calc(0.5rem - 5px);
        top: 0.5rem;
        width: 12px;
        height: 12px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px var(--color-background);
      }
      &:first-child:before {
        top: 0.5rem;
      }
      &:last-child:before {
        height: 1rem;
      }
    }
  }

  @media print {
    :global(html) {
      color-scheme: light;
      --color-background: #fff;
      --color-text: #000;
      --color-text-secondary: #333;
      background: #fff;
    }
    .top-section {
      border-bottom-color: var(--color-text);
    }
    .role,
    .subheader,
    .tech .tech-label {
      color: var(--color-text);
    }
    .section {
      margin-block: 1.25rem 0.5rem;
      color: var(--color-text);
      &::after {
        background: var(--color-text);
      }
    }
    .lead {
      font-size: inherit;
    }
    .tech {
      margin-block: 0.25rem 0.5rem;
      gap: 0;
      code {
        padding: 0;
        background: none;
        font-size: 90%;
        &:not(:last-of-type)::after {
          content: ', ';
          white-space: pre;
        }
      }
      &.skill {
        margin-block: 0 0.25rem;
      }
    }
    ul.lined li {
      padding-left: 0;
      padding-bottom: 1rem;
      &:before,
      &:after {
        display: none;
      }
    }
  }
</style>
